# ============================================================
#  Large media / render output
#  These are build artifacts or oversized source clips:
#    /sample1.mp4  /sample2.mp4  /sample3.mp4          (~118 MB, duplicated)
#    /video-engine/public/sample{1,2,3}.mp4           (same clips, for renders)
#    /video-engine/out/*.mp4                          (rendered output)
#    /video-engine/out.mp4, /video-engine/out_dynamic.mp4
#  Restore locally before rendering; see README.
# ============================================================
*.mp4
video-engine/out/
video-engine/out.mp4
video-engine/out_dynamic.mp4

